+
+Standard revenue is calculated in cents to avoid floating-point precision issues.
+
+Formula:
+
+- grossCents = unitPriceCents * quantity
+- netCents = max(0, grossCents - discountCents - refundedCents)
+
+Inputs must be non-negative integers. Invalid inputs raise an error.

